('B', 'Shows **rigidity and stubbornness**.'),
('P', '**Note the religious exception:** DSM-5-TR specifically says moral and ethical seriousness that reflects the person’s culture or religious identity does not count toward the diagnosis (APA, 2022). Devout faith is not OCPD.'),
