('B', '**Medication (referral notes):** no medication is approved for OCPD; medication may treat co-occurring depression, anxiety, or OCD.'),
('P', '**Cognitive work with OCPD: how it is used** (Strauss et al., 2006; Bamelis et al., 2014):'),
('B', '**Weigh costs and benefits** of perfectionism and control in work, health, and relationships, using the client’s own goals.'),
('B', '**Identify and challenge core beliefs:** "Mistakes are intolerable," "If I don’t do it myself, it won’t be done right," "There is one right way," "Relaxing is wasted time," "I must stay in control or things will fall apart."'),
