('B2', '“Then Jesus declared, ‘The Sabbath was made for man, not man for the Sabbath.’” (Mark 2:27). Rules serve people, not the reverse.'),
('B2', '“In vain you rise early and stay up late, toiling for bread to eat—for He gives sleep to His beloved.” (Psalm 127:2)'),
